 class="h3">Erie</h2><span class="l-c">Erie County · Victorians, frame homes &amp; lake condos</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/reading/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/rowhouse-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/rowhouse-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/rowhouse-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">Southeastern PA</span><h2 class="h3">Reading</h2><span class="l-c">Berks County · Brick rowhouses &amp; Berks farmhouses</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/scranton/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/victorian-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/victorian-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/victorian-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">Northeastern PA</span><h2 class="h3">Scranton</h2><span class="l-c">Lackawanna County · Victorians, double blocks &amp; frame homes</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/lancaster/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/farm-barn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/farm-barn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/farm-barn.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">South Central PA</span><h2 class="h3">Lancaster</h2><span class="l-c">Lancaster County · Brick rows, stone farmhouses &amp; barns</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/harrisburg/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/harrisburg.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/harrisburg-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/harrisburg.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">South Central PA</span><h2 class="h3">Harrisburg</h2><span class="l-c">Dauphin County · Rowhomes, Victorians &amp; suburban homes</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/state-college/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/college-town.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/college-town-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/college-town.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">Central PA</span><h2 class="h3">State College</h2><span class="l-c">Centre County · Student rentals, duplexes &amp; ranches</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/wilkes-barre/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-town.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-town-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-town.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="791" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">Northeastern PA</span><h2 class="h3">Wilkes-Barre</h2><span class="l-c">Luzerne County · Double blocks, frame homes &amp; Victorians</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/york/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/brick-rowhomes-2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/brick-rowhomes-2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/brick-rowhomes-2.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">South Central PA</span><h2 class="h3">York</h2><span class="l-c">York County · Brick rowhouses &amp; suburban homes</span></span></a><a class="l-card rv" href="/where-we-work/johnstown/"><span class="l-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hill-town.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hill-town-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hill-town.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="l-b"><span class="t-kind">Southwestern PA</span><h2 class="h3">Johnstown</h2><span class="l-c">Cambria County · Hillside frame homes &amp; brick rows</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-paper"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv"><p class="kicker">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across Pennsylvania</h2><p>The same policy wording plays out very differently on a rowhome flat roof, a hillside brick house and a stone farmhouse.</p></div><div class="regions" data-stagger><article class="region rv"><div class="region-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/philadelphia.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/philadelphia-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/philadelphia.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Southeastern PA</h3><p>Philadelphia and the collar counties: rowhome flat roofs, party walls, burst pipes in old housing and the Ida-era split between flood and covered water.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/brick-rowhomes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/brick-rowhomes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/brick-rowhomes.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Lehigh Valley &amp; Berks</h3><p>Allentown and Reading: brick rows, twins, warehouses and the limestone sinkhole question that sits under parts of the valley.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/victorian-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/victorian-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/victorian-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Northeastern PA</h3><p>Scranton, Wilkes-Barre and the Poconos: heavy snow, river flooding history and the coal-region mine subsidence issue.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/farm-barn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/farm-barn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/farm-barn.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>South Central PA</h3><p>Harrisburg, Lancaster and York: Susquehanna flooding history, stone farmhouses, bank barns and spring hail.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/college-town.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/college-town-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/college-town.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Central PA</h3><p>State College and the ridge-and-valley country: student rentals, ice storms and wind funnelled along the ridges.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/pittsburgh.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/pittsburgh-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/pittsburgh.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="892" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Western PA</h3><p>Pittsburgh, Johnstown and Erie: hillside homes, flash floods in the hollows and lake-effect snow loads.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
